            "detailed_description": "Ride out into the Old West as a U.S. marshal in the biggest interactive novel ever made! <br><br><i>Tin Star</i> is an interactive western mystery novel where your choices control the story. The game is entirely text-based--without graphics or sound effects--but powered by the vast, unstoppable power of your imagination. <br><br>It's 1,376,197 words long. You'll read 80,000 words each time you play. <br><br>Confront outlaws, find romance, defy the elements, and craft an enduring legend as you uncover a conspiracy whose deadly web stretches from San Francisco to New York City.",
