                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Firstly I would like to note that I stumbled opon this Game out of chance from pure bordom seeking a new game worthy pf a dollar or two,\n\nTin Star blew my mind and exeeds all expectations promiced by the develiper, not only did Tin Star keep me on my toes it made me second guess my decisions and disscuss my last chapter to my partner long after I completed said Chapter, Tin Star invigorates your imagination and allows you to fully immerse yourself in an 1866? World.\n\nI support Special Needs Kids and I have given the rains to a few children who don't particulary enjoy reading, with a little assistance they as I do love the book and the story that begins to unfold by the thought of your decisions.\n\nI know I am Rambling never the less I love this Tec Baised Game 10 Polished Tin Stars out of 10 Dead Raiders.",
